  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n# Cosmetic Dentistry in McLean, VA\n\n\n\n## Troubled Smiles are Transformed Here\n\n\nSchedule Now\n\n\n# Cosmetic Dentistry - McLean, VA\n\n\n\n## Troubled Smiles are Transformed Here\n\n\n\n## It’s Time to Upgrade Your Smile\n\n\nDo you find it difficult to smile openly with others? Are you embarrassed by the appearance of your teeth? You can upgrade your smile with personalized cosmetic dentistry in McLean, VA! Through personalized treatments, including porcelain veneers, dental crowns, and teeth whitening, we can help you find confidence in your smile once again. Our cosmetic dentist is skilled in the artistry and functional aspects of cosmetic dentistry treatment. With a treatment plan tailored to your smile specifications, our Dental Group of Tysons team offers personalized and comfortable care, with predictable and long-lasting results!\n\n\n## What Cosmetic Dentistry Can Correct\n\n\nDiscolored teeth\n\nChipped teeth\n\nGapped teeth\n\nDisproportionate teeth\n\nUneven gumline\n\nAsymmetrical smile\n\nRestore Your Bad or Missing Teeth in A One Day\n\n\n## Free Smile Design Preview\n\n\nUpload a recent photo of yourself and we’ll show you how you can look after All-on-4. Be sure the photo shows your current smile!\n\nUpload Your Picture\n\n\n## Our Select Treatments\n\n\n\n### Porcelain Veneers\n\n\nVeneers in McLean, VA are thin shells of porcelain that cover just the front portion of the teeth that show when you smile. Once your teeth have been modified (a small portion of enamel removed), veneers will fit naturally and restore proper size, shape, and alignment. With minimal maintenance and maximum longevity, veneers are a beneficial and hassle-free choice for renewing your smile.\n\n\n### Dental Crowns\n\n\nCrowns are porcelain or ceramic “caps” for your teeth that conceal cosmetic and functional damage. They are durable and crack-resistant, which makes them a good choice for molars and front teeth that are cracked, broken, or misshapen. A tooth crown can generally last 15 years or more when cared for properly.\n\n\n### Dental Bridges\n\n\nBridges are a fixed replacement for one or more missing teeth. Made up of two or more custom dental crowns fused together, dental bridges effectively restore function and aesthetics to your smile. They can also keep remaining teeth from shifting out of place and altering your bite. Dental bridges can also be attached to dental implants instead of adjacent natural teeth.\n\n\n### Teeth Whitening\n\n\nProfessional teeth whitening ranges from 1-hour whitening sessions in-office to take-home trays or strips with professional-grade bleaching gels. Depending on your time constraints and preferences, whitening can be customized to your needs as well as your specific smile goals. Our cosmetic dentist will monitor your treatment to ensure your whitening has natural and aesthetic results.\n\n\n### This is the heading\n\n\nSometimes teeth only need small cosmetic adjustments to restore their natural aesthetics and function. If you don’t need a complete crown, we offer inlays and onlays to spruce up your smile instead. Inlays replace an inside portion of a tooth and onlays restore one or more cusps of a tooth renewing strength and structure.\n\nView More Results\n\nAll-On-4\n\n\n## Our Patients tell the story best\n\n\nPlay\n\n\n### Complete this short smile Evaluation and receive the following:\n\n\nIf you're a good candidate for veneers\n\nA FREE Digital Smile Design to show you what you will look like with your new veneers!\n\nPricing and options for treatment\n\nAnd best of all... a time to speak directly with Dr. Naahlah. Top Cosmetic Dentists in VA!\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved\n\n\n## Free Smile Preview\n\n\n\n###### Upload a recent photo of yourself and we’ll be in touch as soon as possible.\n\n\n[contact-form-7 id=”5830″ title=”Free Smile Design Preview Upload”]",
